Z||000005||fropuff||09-30-2000||05:15 PM||||I can't get over how cool that looks!  I remember someone saying a while ago that they wanted one with all the panel cracks glassed over.  They said they would take out the molding.  Now that I've seen this, I don't think it would look good at all.  For one thing, what happens when that old geezer in his Oldsmobile backs into you?  I guess you're just screwed over.  Even that guy is if he gets hit.  He will have to replace the front fascia AND the chin spoiler.  I do think it looks cool though.  I wonder what it would look like on my red GT?????......||||reg||1
Z||000006||fropuff||09-30-2000||05:22 PM||||I'm also wondering what size those wheels are.  I really like them as well.  I'm not shopping for wheels right now, but I was wondering.  I like those and the ones that GTgirl?  had on her black GT.  They were like the Impala SS style.  I like the low-profile tires.  <P>By the way, did anyone else notice the red GT next to it?  It looks like it's got the Lambo-style wing on it.  I think Mike Schafer?  was wondering what it looks like.  Can't see much of it, but I don't really like it.  Sorry if I offended anyone...  just my opinion.||||reg||1
